  "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point, going along with the flow (upward and slightly to the right), and crossing the x-nullcline where the tangents are vertical.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/6aa850c4b0fb7cde00bed079de3cde5c2fcfa22c5c2bdae40b43ddb099f27cc7.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory goes to the right and slightly upward to infinity.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/052e7aa9e5dbf874536d9f32268c5d28114067128878e5734beb4a0568ec2a94.png)",
