  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332863\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point, going along with the flow (upward and slightly to the right), and crossing the x-nullcline where the tangents are vertical.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-c4b1b75c449a0711f654a7a498fd7c17\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/c4b1b75c449a0711f654a7a498fd7c17\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>After that, the trajectory goes to the right and slightly upward to infinity.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-a754fbfb76f5b4b6c7b3d513de5577f4\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a754fbfb76f5b4b6c7b3d513de5577f4\"></div><div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-332863-a-2\"></div></div>",
